{% extends "base.txt.j2" %}
{% block content %}
{% set by_owner = deleted_by_owner is defined and deleted_by_owner %}
{{ org_name }} has been scheduled for deletion.

{% if by_owner %}
The owner of {{ org_name }} deleted the workspace on {{ deleted_at }}. Sign-in is blocked from now on. The data stays restorable for {{ grace_days }} days, until {{ purge_at }}; after that it can be removed permanently at any time.

{% else %}
A platform operator marked your workspace for deletion on {{ deleted_at }}. Sign-in is blocked from now on. The data stays restorable for {{ grace_days }} days, until {{ purge_at }}; after that it can be removed permanently at any time.

{% if reason %}
Reason recorded by the operator: {{ reason }}

{% endif %}
{% endif %}
If this was unexpected, contact support immediately. You can restore the workspace from your platform admin contact while it is still within the grace window.

{% if by_owner %}
This action is recorded in your workspace audit log.
{% else %}
This action was performed by a platform operator and is recorded in your workspace audit log.
{% endif %}
{% endblock %}
